WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:01.800
[Quiet nighttime ambience]

00:01.900 --> 00:04.500
[Paper crumples]

00:04.600 --> 00:06.790
[Paper swishes and lands in the bin]

00:06.800 --> 00:08.990
[Fireplace crackles]

00:09.000 --> 00:11.390
[Paper crumples]

00:11.400 --> 00:14.990
[Paper swishes into the fire and burns]

00:15.000 --> 00:17.290
[Atmospheric music]

00:17.300 --> 00:19.690
[Paper crumples over softened music]

00:19.700 --> 00:22.890
[Airy swish and fading absorption sound]
